{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1267,
  "batch_count": 1689,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "55de4ce263af14817647562a7fd0854a4cb17a23",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fec63391329f5c4c7bd2447",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天一整天辛苦了。\r\n……休息也是工作的一部分，\r\n赶快回去睡觉吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd00bc02fb01246543fe9a0c8e646384b7e16833aa2a488d1c5095062d40a8cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:494730cee7500f6f0e467ac7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然晚上有管理员在负责巡视，\r\n但还是不能大意。\r\n一定要确保门窗都有上锁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac04f07bcd8377f3c1f99fa226850b4e6cc0dc7db3fe4b4d05b89f650a6b0094",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72c27fa900e4a4c6100a5c5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然明显看得出大家都还很青涩，\r\n但眼神中却都充满着希望……\r\n值得我以「女帝」之姿来给予引导。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76e5fe024bac4e72f2a39cd3e1c489a3ed6614c85580be009527b4b9436596ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9939d091243aa64231081cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有人会因为过于专注练习跑步\r\n而忘记补充水分……\r\n必须彻底严加指导才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4efd811bf64c3927f014b3d6f5ef8f60456f2f3dd2c78a357524a703464412b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83564a4d6039591cf92e90e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……虽然我会怕虫，\r\n但铃虫的声音很美，我很喜欢。\r\n希望不会有人误把它当成落叶而踩到。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb45fa2676d52c9d11476688ecc47e6bcf83a50caa243b231351798f1f9dc469",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e8426fefb29d456f41200f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天还是吃火锅最好了。没什么，\r\n我想弄个火锅来慰劳一下……后辈。\r\n你只是个负责试味道的重要角色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a24d84dcf73159d2d43ca2c8d96806e7cff4514412438955392234f7110a2c3e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f888df5af26923d2bca2d539",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在是早上！给我打起精神！\r\n抬头挺胸！\r\n驼背的样子太不象话了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c847cfb054b343564a4eaec48229e4dfe9b7e0c909ce95ea62ac53df3ecf711a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53b30fd4e1edd81f75efe36b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，你肩膀上有线头。\r\n一早就这么邋遢……\r\n快点打起精神努力投入工作！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64a2399a011b8c6e8fe8abab5797db1c506ba310666eb8194a5f6abda988df1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c85b8fef92cc31852488f22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可以借用一下训练员室吗？\r\n穿这套衣服一直被后辈们包围，\r\n连午餐都没办法好好吃。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03319102ea15863e8bdd1124aa8dee38bcfb2817667cb3c1701edd08bea1f87d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a86963c436be8044ac12cdf6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天才刚要开始呢。\r\n要抬头挺胸，\r\n保持好仪态才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8adb107fdbdf14f5e399a4aa3ad66324a2f2adae7d3f67f2f42ec593cb83a7f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee0c24f22b468398b572fcf8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还在工作吗？不要努力过头啊……\r\n想要有实力与美丽，\r\n也要先有健康才行啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ae5ba17ba7e5ebce7029cb206361f0cc3cc2a4d1d02e113d79a5a236c9b160e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:990fbfb8b68444cab75bbc26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "熬夜对皮肤不好喔。\r\n训练员也不可以在这点上松懈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d99ede8f553fe0e3b0e1513658b6499855f4e7d67cb82a46f9ef9373fbba1694",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e3bdb53fadb3fa2a982e263",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "花朵盛开的季节……\r\n虽然期待，却也感到有些落寞。\r\n或许为人父母也是这种感觉吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6462f5622692e5c70dcd3782e3038105210502d929b3c326f91954ba3e71b06",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a338c8577e9a2278234c872",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好热啊……来去游泳好了。\r\n我的泳技可是母亲锻炼出来的，\r\n我很有自信。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1adb27c7a3ae1e103bd79818b3ec7a90af104026fde0a7457e93dac3dfd7b7d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bffd4d355a2bd44f790465cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "据说以前的秋天比现在来得冷。\r\n现在的秋天……\r\n有时候穿这样也不会觉得冷。",
      "source_fingerprint": "592d2b1b0d17b6437ea3a004799bcbf8d9d464fd8afb0de40f7367a884657ed8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2a880ad0fb3540fb189ddc7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我说过了，我不会冷！\r\n什么围巾跟手套，我都不需要。\r\n不要一直塞防寒衣物给我……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27df244737a1c6ccef634acb8b5361e41e2825aea46b54b4f3e10585ac31e3ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81e85a0a9dfe866a59b74633",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29fd17b9232cd7d9a4eae43d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25c163b1b2b57563ab97a463",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上，我会查看意见箱应用。\r\n因为晚上收到的学生意见，\r\n我也想尽早了解。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b241803b0c730677f098713dc4a7b157c3488f5f456b56cb7d1b12c9928ff32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0ccf91f0f77ba01292802fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要喝杯红茶提神？\r\n……美妙家寄来的茶叶，\r\n怎么喝，也喝不完……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cb94a0c0a254dab53ed8e0defff0d61cb7752a1d2306826a927cce7b9755f20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f785c25ffd8f83cb87a8702",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "擅自开始侍奉我的人\r\n接连不断……。明明应该先把自己的\r\n饭吃完才对……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9fad340c9ea6a15387f237392a3e982a7acec7e737d6c19328219685bede1e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2c80b05b85a850c1116bbb4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "差不多，该补一次妆了……。\r\n大颗粒亮片虽然华丽\r\n但也有些容易脱妆……嗯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54fb570bb554f577a0459600a1510fc56a4638fe1d4935213ed189e747bffee0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81d40082581befb85db2795f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个学生，眼皮都快睁不开了……\r\n肯定熬夜了。真是的\r\n我还是送她回房间吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c286a70babf91313c25017e2822801458449c29eee7dd9cf02514fb857af52f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26c805c91cbae3a901bc307d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哪怕半夜饿了，\r\n也别听信，恶魔的低语。\r\n……若你不怕恶鬼，那就另当别论。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22ad92fad42bd692471723e898af2c46f9059ea3e88ef60125e2a0c3a5cccf9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb2e8c25b80bdc2d6f706f5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毁坏盛开花朵的害虫――\r\n也该惩治它们了。\r\n让它们，受到制裁……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e2c25c1a3722592c545333ed3b9fcb95d613a633a957fa86e4095ca8fa2e68e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d604eddaa07917c55c660d80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……真是令人烦躁的暑热。想要\r\n换换心情可学园的空调已经全都\r\n清洗过了……还有，打扫……哪里……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b8978abf52dca50dddbc59c768c0f8ffee0b05b457de47e6533bc283940dade",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53410c4fb7b578b2a2903295",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是不是万圣节，\r\n都会有恶作剧的学生。\r\n……好了，该去收取代价了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c08e8791fd93b10b73b4dedcbab54b1d6068020b5c6051665fa41a8b532d46fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1165de9b086be9f3a2745f03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这么冷，就别再逞强了吧。\r\n……律动，觉得好喝吗？\r\n那杯热巧克力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff7350f0570a8eae34f5266e138eab0f7e1d9328cbd7f994c78b4adf44dd6c36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0349f626f9018b3725c77844",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed014ae4d099f9047b3eef35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "铃鹿不是个会把烦恼说出口的人。\r\n但身为朋友……\r\n希望她能多依赖我一点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6fb5b9f292ca7ce2abdc788b6c93f2430935f3bb5209077942aa9a80cea75e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fcd9b4ba40ddd6d93c089a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的眼影跟母亲的一样。\r\n如何？是很有气质的颜色吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8386aa4a8b51abac2cafc7654940727c75b8bce20d15e4bf72505c747e346f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:948cd305b9523d177e9242b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "美妙每天都会来推荐我吃拉面……\r\n但毕竟也不是适合每天吃的东西……哎。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4688864238427b760e7e4d39e1672fea4fc1c7581963170a2ffa4e790c734168",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a13f3b9d7752ad120e5f8b46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶的白仁，\r\n竟然丢下学生会的工作不管……！\r\n喂，你要是看到她就立刻通知我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d602d4b58e6395753ae29b31dce2d82aacb2d1d1fa39d5d75ca6d5c708fe7dbb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19f37791b6daeac24086b840",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……原来啊！我搞懂会长\r\n冷笑话的意思了！虽说懂是懂了……\r\n但说冷笑话的用意究竟是什么……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfb36e03d282683760963d31a8cddded3e2b8fb440587d0a055b586eaf3cd0c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32c77b77f1b332138873fe12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对特雷森学园怀抱憧憬的众多\r\n年幼赛马娘都会看到这个舞台……\r\n必须把我的想法传达给她们才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "750ffe9db00fb1bdc3607a39e1954aafa0cf115764922d4a4dbbf98eaabb1630",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d96be5927f02ae4dd3b3b96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……是机动性很高的服装。\r\n能感觉到制作者的专业……\r\n我的表演必须配得上这套服装才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b2fdbfd9849edbddafadaffe10c427bb636143a474b671ab1c7e3314a09ba9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:350672665e7692407958078c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光靠外观表象的东西可是\r\n撑不起「女帝」的名号。我会在\r\n比赛中让你见识「女帝」的姿态。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dccdd4180abe82f7caeb55e42641f72fb81c9291b277fbe68ee4831dc73c35c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39c0a7516ccf6ae6dac132b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是按照我的意思而制作出来的服装。\r\n为了让它成为荣耀的象征，\r\n每天都要好好地修炼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b35c07aaa9ffeb07da88cc0c6aa1d2c70e8e07faf3e24dbb7b91ab4413a5842c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fd9d8be83d3ebca30b5cc00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在晨会开始前，要先准备好昨天的\r\n会议记录跟申请预算的签名印章……\r\n呼，今天也要努力工作。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d74923afe00f814f22bd61184a7d17450325c285c4509a5c051310b1893429f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b3ce8d4bf186a88c79f58be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "后辈邀请我一起吃午餐，\r\n呵呵……看她邀请我时紧张的模样，\r\n真的觉得很可爱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1909f339a6dcd4ac47a2dffd832459c193870c398759f297db7b399163f668e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:100dfc823e9c12b4d3c64630",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要好好复习课堂上教过的内容，\r\n日积月累的努力才会使自己成长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87e170fde05c2955a537fff1f7cc1a6431a7623b81021a28a70ac6c220acd2c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ab7559523f05f4ab6d2cd7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天是百花绽放的季节。\r\n……呵，让我想要看见\r\n后辈们的笑容呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d73e522c9ca47ac603e09ffe5af7fa9595a7236bf7bf6f232ee71d7ae5b062c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8ea1dc4b7aa1034b62a6efd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年的祭典要穿怎样的浴衣呢？\r\n……反正都要一起去，\r\n就问问看铃鹿的意见好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bfebbbe9bab5a9b33c0f8815339fe17fba2f2a0765a5ba05f2f815a6bce6021",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:388755381d5cbca8851b2a8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽说是食欲之秋，但仍要适量才好。\r\n维持适合奔跑的最佳体态\r\n也是跑者的义务。",
      "source_fingerprint": "becf481ef305c7185c06cbd577597c981d6f0a067b327201755bbf2f30930873",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d676b644641eeecfda364f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔！又是静电吗……\r\n这个时期真的很容易产生静电。\r\n喂，你可要小心别碰到我哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "818b120a95458d4aba8ade9632043c292b588cb8ad0b9bed1a14936828578fe8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1d206e6ac083ee7a65f732a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紫色玫瑰……「荣耀」置于胸前……\r\n呵，不愧是一流设计师的杰作。\r\n真是体现人心……",
      "source_fingerprint": "853142fb9cc9d4158dc800b3528b2eb2d0eb1d26529f2a49a8fe5c88e329ff48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b68989402911e86588c29e88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "人生或许会有大幅变化的转折点……\r\n但我还是想活出自我……\r\n就像我母亲一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f025b2111e29bb8332bf0f2a1b7d4d28fc1f0037ce83359d6bedae63d6191aea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:426cd39ea8329936560e0be6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多伯在那边说什么花童就交给她……\r\n到底是在说什么啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fc6361ed2141e5246e129d66bb6d3506c69eac6a8823199ddc79535f33e1a49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a73b92a0980d4b95b1c56780",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶的白仁……\r\n说我将来一定是比丈夫强势的太太。\r\n我又不是喜欢骂人才骂的……真是。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34c3e1bfe38d66d6204e5d849e8989de94366daca993cb35584505d485a621a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:397b3be605feac5ac95f694a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「美」……\r\n或许是充满哲学的也不一定。\r\n这世界真是无限大……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8060d12b402a94ed550c724c247988ccce11b50a697d30fc9ef711b6b3bbdfc7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8d1c045ed3404c0644a4009",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟然想到用恭喜\r\n来代替早上打招呼说的早安……\r\n真是会开人玩笑……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0447acdff6e92ededf0c0b35cf39d49c34a700a187a46b475283310b23a1e08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8ee1d3a1c7f0b45d519197d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以后要是菱曙又约我吃午餐，\r\n我得记得从早上就不能吃东西……\r\n嗝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c90fd3764c1f6a68ecdc76801d8deeba3a5a6c9913526924fbbaf7c0c7cd788d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d2daf2750d29401fd01910e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "关于晚餐的礼仪，\r\n我被美妙纠正了不少……\r\n看来我要学习的事情还很多。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44d9b5f0dfc8a54dd808643bdb27adff264bbef36f820736d39be2e120744f86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f16a857e2bff9df632905629",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来开始种紫色玫瑰花好了。\r\n一年后的春天，\r\n应该就会开出壮丽的景色吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c4eb57210290a90dc99859dd3b913589b38d49027bc82187bcf8d70514fa756",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e0084fec61a27ae27427e06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件裙子……是丝绸做的啊。\r\n虽然这个布料是很凉爽没错，\r\n但名称让我莫名地不安……",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcff1eb630805a46ad268e690dbc01d308a3f6b8e0db6967b2dddb77a9bcd5ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84424104d8146d7c4a4a7b60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然秋天有很多活动，\r\n但我会赌上这套决胜服……不，\r\n是赌上母亲的名字，完美地完成！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d57ad6904e7198e2943aedd8d8fa62866aaf7a13b742cd4744b3e318939c3590",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d42cadddb2d2a635f41368b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如雪般白皙，是吗……\r\n哈，想不到你也会说出这种\r\n像诗一样的话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "efdcb29fc60ea6e18003ac51b7396a692c78972af8416361f06a19efb0909360",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b82f790e0b8376d85d67dacf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套决胜服……曾经对母亲的\r\n憧憬……想要成为自己憧憬的对象，\r\n就必须也成为别人憧憬的对象。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aeb965e7e72c3dc32618f0fb3624635a1d1dd5953b12cb81c0389fe7243a42df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b7a04985cb18b5bb4a8cd15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "追求强与美而设计出的决胜服……\r\n其中也暗藏着我内心的梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a461ec0fbcaa424d39b985998f29884bc8fe453c0c6f5e06c8966cc01b450532",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc513fa44ab0b43fc399a34c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每次下楼梯时，\r\n会长都会伸手来扶我。\r\n真是的，那位大人的玩笑……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "980631cac6d1c35f5557f9ad80020cdbfd2db5f5c00f93664701c8e133a22d0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e1636cbd8cc6ac020f186d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大鸣那家伙，居然模仿我的\r\n化妆方式……呵呵，虽说线条\r\n颤颤巍巍的，却也很可爱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "621e0761e1736fe57db0bb21992964d49a1c154d11f840d2e37857d8b1f88b9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75338fdb3a249b0a47d568da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学生会的工作，是很好的锻炼。\r\n……好，就强调锻炼这一点\r\n再邀请一次。律动，下次一定。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb66d5a8d98235328e03e65aaca6c78650a69f4cca7accf4378796c5e9e13709",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c1f931f699e6dd34a7eed1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "白仁那家伙……不仅在学生会室\r\n睡午觉，还睡得头发乱翘\r\n……！之前给她的手镜放哪去了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "680295728d798e43ef45c9084bde03a64d0b2fc914fdffaa0da6d547227f4e8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a972b2eec4ff9dd3f6c55dfe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "领衔，又上山了……。\r\n努力磨炼自己是好事……\r\n但闭关时，要先交申请书啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "11fa2cab347a963f424cc94f23968a1fe09e1daa2d890e2c3f1c5529c5499d82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2aedea85a2e600f19102abfe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上到了学园，我就会巡视一圈。\r\n只要看看早晨的脸色，就能\r\n大致了解大家的状态了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "615ca48d9a224eded941625e1a0177778b00b9f75a5134bcda38ecfe042f1cef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b68de4beaed959fb4d79b497",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "统治，邀我一起玩游戏……\r\n但规则实在有些复杂。\r\n……陪我练练。我可不能丢脸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be59464685797fb797ab82308c57216236d3bc0077f767dbb215b94d3526aa50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f788c4141332ac9458d3dc9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "神业那家伙……下次，要还是在熄灯后画\r\n漫画就真没收了。\r\n……不对，之前也曾没收过吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb2d6d77b27dbd9b962e95fbd5d8e54c9dc099502c4eb1fd630ce4fb7f40f0b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39d52054a5f80745a75d1d49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "白天的樱花很好，但夜樱也\r\n十分美丽。浮现在月光下的\r\n白色花瓣，真是幽美……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6c7024350297cd95d67e0143635d4e57e851d14408836f97076dff7a135aa03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72be1cce96a2186c150e92b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这次去札幌，可别太得意忘形了？\r\n目的终究是夏季徒步活动的\r\n考察。观光等一切结束后再说。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36aa2c792f2378bf23990801facea81f17d3dad2127578def94d8eca8907e5a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b049fd17e652af3f4fb350b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "理事长她，将收获的蔬菜分给了\r\n我们。来帮忙，得给那些秋日疲乏的\r\n人补充营养。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4785c4a06e5c9d6e1ed9d2a74a524db01f53402c0b1ecc8e8461acbe89edc69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:daec9e6ee174f148fdd4947b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵……校门口，整齐地摆着\r\n一排雪人。简直就像一家人\r\n一样……暂且不撤走它们吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "409615f387feba6561cb549730720c9d99696f175cc8b535b58ea2390b3806d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27722adba21effc00af7ca74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽是恶魔，却没想过用诱惑\r\n使人堕落……之类的。正因为是恶魔，\r\n才要让你接受地狱般的锻炼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a402c6efb4343ca5e7430845a253a15ddbbb6ed52b76d8f82b82532fb5a016c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9af02394cf480255b5e81360",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到这身衣服，似乎不少学生\r\n都联想到了红心女王。\r\n……真失礼。我可不会施行暴政。",
      "source_fingerprint": "596c7f7bbe76559f0dd64cb21e5b50b45a9f358e7f4cf12a6edd10def2383a24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a109871a37feb3cfc935515",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任何事都没有快捷方式。\r\n不要着急，仔细地反复钻研吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2647930a9eaf274d48369fbfe6cca5a10b463f88b7dc5b4c033ef29936a467c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56543d0233a7916e3bd2d369",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看着吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "66776545941fce875e86a61127b4638ac317d7d99294e6141dac7868d90fe341",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfd8684befceb66b141fc16f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以我目前的实力来看，\r\n该做的事情应该很清楚了。\r\n你可不要做出错误的判断。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b09672e65fe72074a750d4e044feb2a829f156d2f9adad6b1b02b764fbb1241",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f85414f2678244003d97689",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要做就要尽全力去做。\r\n千万不要有偷懒的行为。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62803e006b52d37b524beaca88f0a0441614667a46ec2d161a7970edafaab87e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cb60a66bf04cbf8af32ab03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经准备好了，开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad1d1a802d1d255df9ce1feff39a9e37c2dc4d01ebacde2f679294886d9f057a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e81af7000a358f0d9ba5e98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的行程已经安排好了吗？\r\n……不要慌张，好好想想吧。\r\n我还是有时间可以等你的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db75461b88c57acba3488b44c0f87f9e93f638c324b3198f367750ef0857c4b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f54d0622564d486ec0b56b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
